@function DAMAGE_ApplyDamageToUnit
@address Game.exe.ram:0057c6c0
@date 2026.06.20
@calling __fastcall
@description Core server-side damage-application routine. Validates the attacker can hit the victim (UNITS_CheckIfCanAttackTarget, town/killable rules) then optionally applies defensive reduction, dispatches hit/got-hit unit events, clamps physical damage to current HP, runs life/mana leech, healing, then subtracts total damage from the victim's hitpoints (clamping the sub-256 remainder to 0). Also applies drain (mana/stamina) and status effects: stun, cold, freeze, poison, burning. Sets wResultFlags death bit (2) when HP reaches 0, otherwise schedules HP-regen events for monsters and clears Assassin charge-up states; dispatches death events on kill. Mutates pDamage and victim stats in place.

